ee"}],null]}]]}],["$","$L7",null,{"onMount":true,"delay":0.2,"y":12,"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"head-lede","children":"The free, open source tool from the video. You give it a website, an app or a game, it studies what a visitor can see, Claude Code builds your own version, and then it checks the copy against the original. A one prompt install, how to run your first build, and the fixes for the two bugs people keep hitting."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"head-action","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/storytold/craft-anything","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"btn-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm","children":["Get Craft Anything on GitHub"," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"children":"↗"}]]}]}]]}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"cover","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/covers/craft-anything-clean-room-clone.webp","width":1200,"height":800,"alt":"","fetchPriority":"high","decoding":"async"}],["$","canvas",null,{"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"sheet","children":[["$","canvas",null,{"className":"seam","data-seam":"#F5F2EA","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pad sheet-in","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"read guide","children":["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-5 py-4 leading-[1.7] text-ink","children":"This is the page for anyone who commented REPO on the Craft Anything video. Only download it from github.com/storytold/craft-anything. It's early alpha, with three releases in three days, so if a step here doesn't match what you see, the README wins."}],["$","h2","1",{"className":"mt-12 t-h3 text-ink","children":"What it does"}],["$","p","2",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"REA looks inside an app's code to work out how it works. Craft Anything can start from the outside instead. In Clean room mode, which is the default, nothing inside the original is read: not its code, its files or its page source. It works from what you'd see as a visitor, so screenshots, the visible text, the measured layout, colors, fonts and spacing, and the menus opened up. Then Claude Code builds your version from scratch."}],["$","p","3",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"The part REA doesn't have is the check at the end. Every build gets compared with the original (a website at three screen widths, an app by running it, a game by its own self test), and it keeps refining until the two are close. Each check says how alike they are and lists what doesn't match yet."}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25"]}]}],"$L26"]}]]}],"$L27"]
