24:["$","div","17",{"className":"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-5 py-4 leading-[1.7] text-ink","children":"Use it on software you own or are allowed to examine. It never gets past DRM, logins or anti-cheat, and it's told not to copy logos, photos or text unless you confirm you own them or have permission. So your build gets the layout and the behavior, and you bring your own name and art."}]
